12
00:00:40,220 --> 00:00:41,260
Make sure you listen.

13
00:00:50,120 --> 00:00:54,120
When you watch it, turn on the lights
and sit back a bit from the TV, okay?

14
00:01:03,920 --> 00:01:07,220
Anyone who's broke, come to me.

15
00:01:07,220 --> 00:01:11,960
I've got no money either,
but don't worry about it.

16
00:01:11,960 --> 00:01:19,020
Look at that, blue sky, white clouds.

17
00:01:20,640 --> 00:01:25,680
It'll all work out somehow, eventually.

18
00:01:27,600 --> 00:01:30,960
You get it, right? Got it, got it.

19
00:01:30,960 --> 00:01:34,980
Once you understand, just follow me quietly.

20
00:01:48,220 --> 00:01:50,380
This is Kameari Broadcasting Station.

21
00:01:54,620 --> 00:01:55,800
It's Yoppe.

22
00:01:55,800 --> 00:01:57,260
It's now 10 p.m.

23
00:01:57,260 --> 00:02:00,200
Tonight's Wai Wai Paradise is starting now.

24
00:02:00,200 --> 00:02:01,400
Now, today we have

25
00:02:01,400 --> 00:02:03,680
Katsushika Ward's famous police officer

26
