Mm...

29
00:02:09,040 --> 00:02:09,820
Mm...

30
00:02:09,820 --> 00:02:12,860
Mm...

31
00:02:13,440 --> 00:02:14,787
Sorry, sorry,

32
00:02:14,837 --> 00:02:18,680
I went and ate eight servings of gyoza
and liver with garlic chives for dinner, so

33
00:02:18,680 --> 00:02:19,620
Uh

34
00:02:19,620 --> 00:02:22,426
Yo, I'm Kankichi Ryotsu,

35
00:02:22,476 --> 00:02:24,440
so just call me Ryo-san.

36
00:02:24,440 --> 00:02:25,660
Y-yes, right.

37
00:02:26,420 --> 00:02:28,320
So by the way, Ryo-san,

38
00:02:28,370 --> 00:02:31,520
I hear you work at the
Kameari Park police box.

39
00:02:32,120 --> 00:02:34,860
Yeah, that area's like my own backyard.

40
00:02:34,860 --> 00:02:39,600
From the obscure model shops to the pachinko parlors,
I know it all.

41
00:02:39,600 --> 00:02:41,240
P-pachinko parlors?

42
00:02:41,360 --> 00:02:44,160
Yeah, there's this place
called Pachinko Plaza Kamedas.

43
00:02:44,540 --> 00:02:46,940
It's a really customer-friendly place.

44
00:02:46,940 --> 00:02:49,349
The nails are loose and
the reels spin like crazy,

45
00:02:49,399 --> 00:02:50,980
