89
00:04:31,880 --> 00:04:35,700
"That's all"? For me, it's a really,
really important matter, you know!

90
00:04:36,280 --> 00:04:37,520
"Such a trivial thing"?

91
00:04:37,520 --> 00:04:40,500
Don't waste your time agonizing
over something like that!

92
00:04:40,900 --> 00:04:45,740
If you've got time to call in here,
then hurry up and confess, hurry!

93
00:04:45,740 --> 00:04:46,860
Confess?

94
00:04:46,860 --> 00:04:48,816
That's right. If you like someone,

95
00:04:48,866 --> 00:04:51,800
