and be done with it, got it?

96
00:04:52,160 --> 00:04:53,400
B-but...

97
00:04:53,400 --> 00:04:55,660
It's hard to say it outright Mr. A?

98
00:04:56,280 --> 00:04:57,040
Yes...

99
00:04:57,920 --> 00:05:01,680
Then how about sending a love letter,
or an email?

100
00:05:01,920 --> 00:05:06,960
No way! Not that!
I won't allow such a roundabout method!

101
00:05:07,420 --> 00:05:10,860
A man who hesitates should go for it and shatter!
Understand?

102
00:05:11,060 --> 00:05:12,080
Y-yes...

103
00:05:12,080 --> 00:05:12,900
Good, next one.

104
00:05:13,380 --> 00:05:16,220
No but what if it doesn't work out...

105
00:05:16,860 --> 00:05:19,360
I don't care, next, next!

106
00:05:21,520 --> 00:05:30,180
Next caller, go ahead. Hello? What's your problem?
Lately I've been really wanting to confront my boyfriend about something.

107
00:05:30,600 --> 00:05:36,280
He never calls me, and he's always saying he's busy and won't go on dates with me.
He must be cheating.

108
00:05:36,280 --> 00:05:38,400
Hey, wait a minute!

109
00:05:38,400 --> 00:05:39,780
Don't decide that on your own!

110
00:05:39,780 --> 00:05:41,940
Picking a fight or giving up,
that's what matters!

111
00:05:42,880 --> 00:05:44,480
I'm done for.

112
00:05:44,480 --> 00:05:45,680
What happened?

113
00:05:45,820 --> 00:05:47,100
I got laid off at work,

114
00:05:47,100 --> 00:05:48,300
