144
00:06:47,180 --> 00:06:50,200
It's a four-piece set of
top-grade cowhide leather bags.

145
00:06:51,500 --> 00:06:52,600
What a lovely bag.

146
00:06:53,000 --> 00:06:54,040
This product

147
00:06:54,040 --> 00:06:57,380
