want him back tomorrow.

184
00:08:11,700 --> 00:08:13,880
It's the biggest response
since the show began!

185
00:08:13,880 --> 00:08:15,340
Fantastic, fantastic!

186
00:08:16,240 --> 00:08:19,660
Well, the other day,
Akashingō's master, Sugi Heisuke,

187
00:08:19,660 --> 00:08:21,540
