because I'm making a show for them.

201
00:08:58,240 --> 00:09:00,320
Don't forget to tune in, alright?

202
00:09:05,120 --> 00:09:06,200
Around 5 o'clock today,

203
00:09:06,720 --> 00:09:08,520
No-Ishimaatsu

204
00:09:08,520 --> 00:09:10,420
Nakagawa, are you listening?

205
00:09:12,260 --> 00:09:13,660
There it is, there it is.

206
00:09:15,320 --> 00:09:17,640
How is it that Senpai's voice

207
00:09:17,640 --> 00:09:19,920
this show that started today

208
00:09:19,920 --> 00:09:22,540
with Ryo-san again tonight
for two or three hours

209
00:09:22,540 --> 00:09:26,020
I'm Kankichi Ryotsu, your host.
Nice to meet you.

210
00:09:26,020 --> 00:09:28,680
Senpai is the host.

211
00:09:28,680 --> 00:09:31,300
By the way, Nakagawa is my subordinate,

212
00:09:31,300 --> 00:09:34,500
