three or four extra guts' worth of money.

213
00:09:34,860 --> 00:09:38,620
He's probably cruising around Roppongi
in his beloved Ferrari right now.

214
00:09:38,620 --> 00:09:40,980
Just say the word and he'll
buy you as much as you want,

215
00:09:40,980 --> 00:09:42,940
so if you spot him, go say hi.

216
00:09:42,940 --> 00:09:45,900
The car's license plate
is Shinagawa-san's...

217
00:09:45,900 --> 00:09:46,720
Sanoyo

218
00:09:46,720 --> 00:09:47,300
Whoa!

219
00:09:47,300 --> 00:09:47,820
Whoa!

220
00:09:48,320 --> 00:09:53,660
Whoa!

221
00:09:58,660 --> 00:09:59,460
Wait a moment, please.

222
00:10:01,160 --> 00:10:01,560
Right.

223
00:10:02,480 --> 00:10:05,200
I had a really embarrassing experience.

224
00:10:06,000 --> 00:10:08,540
So this man is Honda's senior, is he?

225
00:10:10,180 --> 00:10:13,960
That's right, he's usually a
pretty aggressive guy, you know.

226
00:10:14,480 --> 00:10:17,460
Who would have thought he'd
even become a radio personality?

227
00:10:17,460 --> 00:10:18,060
Yeah.

228
00:10:18,980 --> 00:10:22,860
Speaking of embarrassing experiences,
I have a colleague named Honda.

229
00:10:23,500 --> 00:10:27,240
When it comes to embarrassing,
nobody beats this guy.

230
00:10:28,840 --> 00:10:32,020
He's a real
"me-first" type, though he's calmed down now.

231
00:10:32,020 --> 00:10:35,140
Back then, he'd hit on any
girl he saw and get shot down.

232
00:10:35,140 --> 00:10:37,840
Every night, I'd be dragged
along to drink away his sorrows.

233
00:10:38,260 --> 00:10:40,160
And yet his ideals are always sky-high.

234
00:10:40,160 --> 00:10:42,780
"I'm going to marry a girl who's
half Kyoko Koizumi, half Miho Nakayama..."

235
00:10:42,780 --> 00:10:45,320
...split right down the middle.

236
00:10:45,320 --> 00:10:46,140
What's he going on about?

237
00:10:46,140 --> 00:10:48,640
He really needs to know his place.

238
00:10:48,640 --> 00:10:49,620
Are you listening, Honda?

239
00:10:52,540 --> 00:10:54,200
Ryo-chan is really on the air.

240
00:10:54,200 --> 00:10:56,680
It's as wild a show as ever.

241
00:10:57,060 --> 00:10:59,920
